+- Core:
+  - Improvement:
+    - #30005: Update Classic to v2.0.5 (by @kpodemski)
+  - Bug fix:
+    - #30116: Update twig dependency (by @jolelievre)
+    - #30080: Do not force new translation system when no domain is provided (by @atomiix)
+
